{"task_id": "HumanEval/50", "solution": "```python\ndef decode_shift(s: str):\n    \"\"\"\n    takes as input string encoded with encode_shift function. Returns decoded string.\n    \"\"\"\n    _SHIFT_VALUE = 5\n    _ALPHABET_SIZE = 26\n    _ORD_A = ord('a')\n    decoded_chars = []\n    for ch in s:\n        # Add _ALPHABET_SIZE before modulo to ensure positive result for negative shifts\n        shifted_ord = ((ord(ch) - _ORD_A - _SHIFT_VALUE + _ALPHABET_SIZE) % _ALPHABET_SIZE) + _ORD_A\n        decoded_chars.append(chr(shifted_ord))\n    return \"\".join(decoded_chars)\n```"}
